          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses answered, “Then you would have to provide us with animals for sacrifices and burnt offerings to offer to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No, we will take our animals with us; not one will be left behind. We ourselves must select the animals with which to worship the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God. And until we get there, we will not know what animals to sacrifice to him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
